Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: apple,macaudio: Add the J616s

The J616s (MacBook Pro 16" M4 Pro) speaker card runs on the AOP audio
component instead of the MCA. Add its compatible.

Signed-off-by: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit 4925bbe2cc1374e2a0c8daf6b100e3bbc9e98736)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
index 8e986cca62..0c364fdac5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
           - apple,j274-macaudio
           - apple,j293-macaudio
           - apple,j314-macaudio
+          - apple,j616-macaudio
           - apple,j700-macaudio
       - const: apple,macaudio
 
